Usage is reported.
RUN: not %t.sequential2 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=USAGE
RUN: env LIFE_SIZE=1 not %t.sequential2 partner 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=USAGE
USAGE: usage: life_two partner | life_two first PORT
USAGE-NEXT: LIFE_SIZE must be at least 2 and LIFE_STEPS at least 2.
